config SECMON
	bool "Enable Security Monitoring Module"
	default y
	help
	  This module provides lightweight kernel monitoring for process
	  activity, suspicious privilege usage, and security-related event
	  logging. It is intended for embedded Linux hardening experiments
	  and security auditing demonstrations.

if SECMON

config SECMON_LOG_LEVEL
	int "Security monitor log level"
	default 4
	help
	  Higher values produce more verbose diagnostics. Use a low value
	  for production-oriented systems.

endif
